# システム環境設定's 〈機器〉〈機器情報〉「プロセッサ」 (docs/tessronos/04-kernel.md 4.5.1, 11-desktop.md), for
# tools/x64/ui_run64.py with the image of make TARGET=_X64_ DESKTOP=1 UITEST=1 sdimg, run with 4 processors:
# the processors and their roles, PRC 2 made one for the chores and back (the machine's settings CPU_CHORE and
# CPU_RT, which the users may write and the system takes at once), and the disk's interrupts sent to PRC 2
# through the disk's object (irq.cpu), which only an administrator may write: the user is told so. The window
# is at 160,80: 「プロセッサ」 is the eighth line of 〈機器情報〉 at 230,303 and 表示 at 706,185; on the page
# the second line of the processors at 316,205, the roles 普通 and 雑務 at 506,220 and 506,251, the role's 設定
# at 708,355; the first line of the interrupts at 356,467, the processor's field at 604,495 and its 設定 at
# 708,495; the panel's 確認 at 627,372. Ctrl+E closes.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 3000
click 230 303
wait 500
click 706 185
expect sysenv: processors 4 chores 1 real-time
wait 1000
shot cpu_page
# PRC 2 for the chores
click 316 205
wait 300
click 506 251
wait 300
click 708 355
expect sysenv: roles CPU_CHORE 1-2 CPU_RT
expect cpu: roles: for chores 2, for real time 0
wait 800
shot cpu_chore
# and back
click 316 205
wait 300
click 506 220
wait 300
click 708 355
expect sysenv: roles CPU_CHORE 1 CPU_RT
expect cpu: roles: for chores 1, for real time 0
# the disk's interrupts to PRC 2: an administrator's to set
click 356 467
wait 300
click 604 495
key 2a
key 2a
key 2a
key 2a
text 2
wait 300
click 708 495
expect sysenv: interrupts of nvmea to 2
wait 800
shot cpu_irq
click 627 372
wait 500
key 08 01
expect sysenv: closed
